  "outlineNotes": {
    "electrical": "Module numbering follows the supplied slides, which move from Module 3 to Module 5.",
    "sensor": "Module 3 (Limit Switches) and Module 4 (Timers) are listed on the Day 2 divider. Electronic-sensor introduction has no visible Module 6 label in the readable slides, so it is listed by topic. Module 7 retains its slide number.",
    "pneumatic": "The readable deck explicitly labels Modules 3–7. Its earlier material is grouped by slide topic without assigning unverified Module 1/2 labels. Module 7 is titled Automatic Input Devices 1 in the slides; its content covers air preparation, filtration, lubrication and leaks.",
    "mechanical": "Sections follow the day breaks in the Mechanical Power slides.",
    "alignment": "Day 1 follows the slide topics; Day 2 uses the three named segments on the course outline.",
    "conveyor": "This deck uses topic headings rather than numbered modules.",
    "lab": "Labs are grouped by the supplied lab packet; they are not additional numbered lecture modules.",
    "math": "These are the three sessions named in the Amazon math packet.",
    "saca": "Mixed review follows each course’s modules and sections. Choose a course/module below or keep all courses mixed.",
    "motor": "Eight modules follow C202 Electric Motor Controls.pdf, followed by its troubleshooting section. Original cropped diagrams accompany image questions."
  },
